.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "TypeScript API Utils"
.PP

.PP

.PP
Utility functions for working with TypeScript's API\&. Successor to the wonderful tsutils\&. 🛠️️ 

.PP

.PP

.PP

.PP
\fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP  
.SS "Usage"
.PP
.nf
npm i ts\-api\-utils
.fi
.PP

.PP
.PP
.nf
import * as tsutils from "ts\-api\-utils";

tsutils\&.forEachToken(/* \&.\&.\&. */);
.fi
.PP
.SS "API"
\fRts-api-utils\fP provides many utility functions\&. Check out our API docs for details:

